# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/WSL 双端来回翻转
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本必须 LF，否则 Linux/WSL 下会 bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
